Changes made in this version (2026-09-27):

- SKILL.md was rewritten for use with a highly capable model (Claude
  Opus 5.5): rationale paragraphs, numeric spacing formulas, instructions
  to write the XML in several chunks and to keep work files out of /tmp,
  and forceful trigger wording in the description were removed. The
  layout, icon, label, edge and decoration rules and the draw.io
  pitfalls were kept as short bullet lists.
- The Internet Gateway rule was changed: the IGW sits above the AZ
  frames in line with the ALB, and the inbound request path is drawn
  through it (CloudFront -> IGW -> ALB), with outbound traffic drawn
  ECS -> NAT Gateway -> IGW. The original placed the IGW directly above
  the ALB, which blocked the ALB's top-center entry point.
- references/cli.md and references/edit.md were merged into SKILL.md.
- references/styles.md was condensed into tables; the style strings,
  category colors and icon names are unchanged.

This skill is not an official AWS or draw.io product.
